  "description": "Shared canal-agnostic agent core — Mastra orchestration + substitutable ports (memory/vector/graph/tools/workflow/storage) + api.ori3com.cloud LLM seam. Consumed identically by o3c-code-cli, o3c-work, o3c-browser, chat2, mcp.",
  "type": "module",
